the truth.","from":28},{"book":"EZK","chapter":20,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"I also gave them My Sabbaths as a sign between us, so that they would know that I am the LORD who sanctifies them.","from":28},{"book":"EZK","chapter":36,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"Then you will live in the land that I gave your forefathers; you will be My people, and I will be your God.","from":23}],"notes":[{"id":"lev-26-11-living-temple","title":"I will dwell among them and walk among them","kind":"prophecy"},{"id":"temple-body","title":"The temple destroyed and raised","kind":"type"},{"id":"isa-11-11-second-gathering","title":"The second gathering of the remnant","kind":"prophecy"},{"id":"rev-20-millennium","title":"The thousand years","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":3},{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":2}]}}